# One line ending in the repository, whatever the checkout.
#
# This file exists because two commits in this project nearly went in as full-file rewrites: a
# source file had been saved with CRLF while everything around it was LF, so git saw all 3,600
# lines as changed and the real 200-line diff was invisible inside it. Normalising on the way in
# means a Windows editor can do whatever it likes locally and the history stays readable.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows entry points have to keep CRLF or cmd.exe mis-parses them.
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

# Never touch bytes.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.xlsx binary
*.xls binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
